// Module under test: lib/filter.csp, loaded by {lib, ...} in the .expect.
// A steady 10.0 with one single-sample spike of 99.0. Med must never show the
// spike -- one bad sample out of three can never be the middle one. `s` adds
// smoothing on top and must converge on the same value.
#variable n = 0
#variable Src float = 0.0
#Filter f T.period=5
#Filter s T.period=5 Alpha=0.5
n = n + 1
Src = 10.0 ? n != 5
Src = 99.0 ? n == 5
f.In = Src
s.In = Src
